  "notes": [
    "Reflexive -AR verb. Uses reflexive pronouns (me/te/se/nos/se) in all tenses.",
    "Spelling change in yo pretérito indefinido: c→qu to preserve the /k/ sound before -é: *me acerqué* (not *acercé*). All other forms are regular.",
    "Regular past participle: *acercado*",
    "Base verb: *acercar* (to bring/move something closer — non-reflexive). *Acercarse* = to move oneself closer, to approach.",
    "*Me acerqué a la ventana para ver mejor.* (I approached the window to see better.)",
    "*El tren se acerca a la estación.* (The train is approaching the station.)",
    "Opposite: *alejarse* (to move away)"
  ],
